        "text": "In logical terms, this can be written as:\n\n∃x (P(x) ∧ E(x)) ∧ ∀y (P(y) ∧ E(y) → y = x)"
      },
      {
        "label": "uncertainty-estimation",
        "text": "Wait, let me make sure I got that right."
