        "text": "Let me compute the residues of each element in S modulo 3:\n\n- 1 mod 3 = 1\n- 2 mod 3 = 2\n- 3 mod 3 = 0\n- 4 mod 3 = 1 (since 4 - 3 = 1)\n- 5 mod 3 = 2 (since 5 - 3 = 2)\n- 6 mod 3 = 0\n\nSo, the residues are: {1, 2, 0, 1, 2, 0}."
