        "label": "deduction",
        "text": "If each edge has 4 smaller cubes, and we exclude the two corners, that leaves 2 cubes per edge with exactly two red faces. Since a cube has 12 edges, the total number of such cubes should be 12 multiplied by 2, which is 24."
      },
      {
        "label": "uncertainty-estimation",
        "text": "So, is the answer 24?"
