        "text": "Maybe using the formula for the number of cubes with exactly two red faces in a cube. I remember that in a cube of size n x n x n, the number of smaller cubes with exactly two red faces is 12*(n-2). Because for each edge, you have (n-2) cubes with exactly two red faces. Since each edge is independent, you multiply by 12 edges."
      },
